{
  "version": "0.9.15",
  "notes": "Show verified visual-analysis readiness ticks in Skyrim tools and the sidebar; update checking/download/unavailable states without automatic model downloads. Add a quiet local reply chime with a persistent per-browser mute toggle, no history/duplicate notifications, and notification of pending replies after switching chats. Move recent chats into a compact top-aligned scrolling list, sort by actual activity dates and improve same-second timestamp precision. Replace send glyph with an accessible upward-arrow control. Remove Live support and manual Update controls, plus sidebar Capabilities, while retaining automatic updates and shared data. Verify real browser audio, scrolling, status and chat flows.",
